Wealth, transformations, harems... Ruby Sheeplock, the Queen of the Sheeple, attained everything this world has to offer.
The words she uttered just before her disappearance drove sheep to the frontier.
join ruby center
ruby: My food? If you want it, you can have it!
ruby: Find it! I left every crop this world has to offer there!
leave ruby
And so sheep head for the Grand Plateau in pursuit of their dreams! The world has truly entered a Great Sheeple Era!